//Conflict

### Get Conflict - Lista completa de conflictos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts
Accept: application/json


### Get Conflict By Id - Obtener conflicto por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts/1
Accept: application/json


### Get Conflict By Status ACTIVE - Endpoint avanzado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts?status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json


### Post Conflict - Crear un nuevo conflicto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HttpRequest Test Conflict",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "description": "Conflicto creado usando el plugin HttpRequest"
}


### Put Conflict By Id - Actualizar conflicto existente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Conflict",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "status": "FROZEN",
  "description": "Conflicto actualizado usando el plugin HttpRequest"
}


### Delete Conflict By Id - Eliminar conflicto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts/3


### Get Conflict By Id - Verificar eliminación
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts/3
Accept: application/json





//Country

### Get Country - Lista completa de países
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries
Accept: application/json


### Get Country By Id - Obtener país por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries/1
Accept: application/json


### Get Country By Code - Obtener país por código
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries/code/UKR
Accept: application/json


### Post Country - Crear un nuevo país
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Country",
  "code": "TST"
}


### Put Country By Id - Actualizar país existente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Country",
  "code": "UPD"
}


### Delete Country By Id - Eliminar país
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries/4

### Get Country By Id - Verificar eliminación
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/countries/4
Accept: application/json





//Faction

### Get Faction - Lista completa de facciones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions
Accept: application/json


### Get Faction By Id - Obtener facción por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions/3
Accept: application/json


### Post Faction - Crear una nueva facción
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Faction"
}


### Put Faction By Id - Actualizar facción existente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Faction"
}


### Post Faction Add Country - Añadir país a una facción
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions/4/countries/1

### Get Faction By Id - Comprobar países asociados
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions/4
Accept: application/json

### Delete Faction By Id - Eliminar facción
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/factions/4






//Event

### Get Event - Lista completa de eventos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Accept: application/json


### Get Event By Id - Obtener evento por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/3
Accept: application/json


### Post Event - Crear un nuevo evento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventDate": "2024-06-01",
  "location": "Kyiv",
  "description": "Event created using HttpRequest plugin"
}


### Put Event By Id - Actualizar evento existente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventDate": "2024-06-15",
  "location": "Updated location",
  "description": "Updated event description"
}


### Get Event By Id - Verificar actualización
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/4
Accept: application/json


### Delete Event By Id - Eliminar evento
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/4

